{
  "$comment": "SnapTape regression cases v1. Values in mm unless noted. Sources: Bestand plans (Rapp+Tochtenhagen 2019, luka architekten 2012) and the July 2026 GT protocol. tolerance_percent applies to premium runs; standard runs are allowed 2x the tolerance. Cases with expect:null are smoke cases: the run must complete and pass validation, values are recorded but not asserted.",
